#___________________________________________________________________
#
# File: ss1.dat
#
# Description: Data file used by wizard.pl to run the solar system
#	       game.
#
# The following data is used to set the environment variables for the
#   question and answer pages generated by the CGI program.  This information
#   is specific to each category.
#
# ENVIRONMENT         Indicates the start of the environment data.
# BACKGROUND COLOR=   Set this if no background image is used.  Otherwise "".
# BACKGROUND IMAGE=   The background image.  Set to "" if not used.
# TEXT COLOR=         The color of the text.
# COVERPAGE ICON=     The icon used to return to the cover page.
# COVERPAGE FILENAME= The coverpage file name.
# CATEGORY FILENAME=  The main category file name such as the zoo or school 
#                       page. 
# CATEGORY ICON=      The icon for returning to the main category page.
# CATAGORY TEXT=      The text to go with the catagory icon.
#_________________________________________________________________________

ENVIRONMENT
BACKGROUND COLOR="#000000"
BACKGROUND IMAGE=""
TEXT COLOR="#FFFFFF"
COVERPAGE ICON="ss_icon.gif"
COVERPAGE FILENAME=""
HELP FILENAME=""
CATAGORY FILENAME="museum"
CATAGORY ICON="museum.gif"
CATAGORY TEXT="Return to Museum"


#______________The records begin here__________________

.
QUESTION	Which picture shows the only star in our Solar System?
INCORRECT_ANS1	Earth is one of the nine planets that orbit the Sun.
IMG1	c_ear1.gif
INCORRECT_ANS2	Venus is the second planet from the Sun.
IMG2	c_ven1.gif
CORRECT_ANS	The Sun is the only star in our Solar System.
IMG3	c_sun1.gif
INCORRECT_ANS3	Saturn is a planet that orbits the only star in our Solar System.
IMG4	c_sat3.gif
.
QUESTION	Which planet is the smallest and is furthest from the Sun?
INCORRECT_ANS1	Jupiter is the largest planet in our Solar System.
IMG1	c_jup1.gif
INCORRECT_ANS2	Venus is larger than the smallest planet.
IMG2	c_ven1.gif
CORRECT_ANS	Pluto is the smallest planet and is furthest from the Sun.
IMG3	c_plu1.gif
INCORRECT_ANS3	Saturn is second largest planet.
IMG4	c_sat3.gif
.
QUESTION	Which picture shows the planet that is closest to the Sun?
